1. Consensual - Aapsi sehmati se/Means mutual, The agreement was consensual between both companies.
2. Impeccable - Bilkul perfect, The thing which has no mistake/ Nirdosh.
3. Scoundrel - Badmash aadmi, Beimaan ya dhokebaaz vyakti, Characterless person.
4. Grumpy - Chidchida, Gusse wala mood, Asani se irritate ho jana.
5. Consent - Permission dena. Eg: She gave her consent. 

6. Iron Fist: Kadi discipline se rule karna, Bahut sakhti se control karna. Zara si galati per bhi strict action lena.
 - Sentence: He rules with an iron fist.

7. Emergence (Noun): Start, beginning, rise. Ubharna.
 - The emergence of AI has caused worry among professionals across the globe.

8. Contamination: Kisi cheez ka ganda ya impure ho jana.
 - The food got contaminated due to poor hygiene.

9. Pathetic: Bahut bekaar, very bad, bilkul disappointing. Itna bura ki dekhkar taras aa jaye.
 - Don't act so pathetic. - Itna bekar/helpless mat behave karo.

10. Dabbler: Koi vyakti jo sirf thoda-thoda try karta hai, kisi kaam ko seriously ya deeply nahi seekhta.
 - He is just a dabbler in music.

11. Defuse: Shant Karna. 
 - United States President Donald Trump has once again claimed that he helped defuse a military conflict between India and Pakistan.



